{"version":1,"id":"ed-sheeran-galway-girl","title":"Galway Girl","artist":"Ed Sheeran","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/ed-sheeran/galway-girl-/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: John Macdaid (Gb), Amy Wadge, Ed Sheeran, Foy Vance, Liam Padraig Bradley, Niamh Dunne, Sean Brendan Graham, Damien Gerard Mckee and Eamon Murray","chords":[{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D9","canonical":"Dadd9","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,4,6],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Dadd9"},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"She played the fiddle in an Irish band","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"But she fell in love with an English man","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D9","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Said baby I just want to dance","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I met her on Grafton street right outside of the bar","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"She shared a cigarette with me while her brother played the guitar","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"She asked me what does it mean the Gaelic ink on your arm?","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Said it was one of my friend's songs do you want to drink on?","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"She took Jamie as a chaser, Jack for the fun","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"She got Arthur on the table, with Johnny riding as shotgun","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Chatted some more, one more drink at the bar","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Then put Van on the jukebox, got up to dance, you know","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"She played the fiddle in an Irish band","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"But she fell in love with an English man","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Said baby I just want to dance","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"With my pretty little Galway Girl","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":29,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m","column":40,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"You're my pretty little Galway Girl","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m","column":40,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"section","text":"[Riff]","columns":6,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"You know she beat me at darts and then she beat me at pool","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"And then she kissed me like there was nobody else in the room","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"As last orders were called, was when she stood on the stool","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"After dancing the Cèilidh, singing to trad tunes","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I never heard Carrickfergus ever sung so sweet","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Acapella in the bar using her feet for the beat","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, I could have that voice playing on repeat for a week","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"And in this packed out room, swear she was singing to me","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"She played the fiddle in an Irish band","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"But she fell in love with an English man","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Said baby I just want to dance","columns":30,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"With my pretty little Galway Girl","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":23,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"My, my, my, my, my, my, my Galway Girl","columns":38,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":29,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":35,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"My, my, my, my, my, my, my Galway Girl","columns":38,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":29,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":35,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"My, my, my, my, my, my, my Galway Girl","columns":48,"beats":12,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":29,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":35,"beat":6},{"symbol":"E","column":41,"beat":8},{"symbol":"F#m","column":45,"beat":10}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Now we'